# Both ways to cast a modal double-faced card offered at once (CR 712.2): the front face for {1}{W} and the back
# face for {3}{G}{W}{W}, on one card in hand. Handed over at the priority prompt that offers them, so the menu a
# click on the card opens can be pictured:
#
# then click Jennifer Walters in hand.
#
# That casting the back face works is jennifer-walters-is-cast-as-her-back-face.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains x3
Forest x3
Jennifer Walters
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
